  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fbb0b7ca83a252c418a87c8ce8a465ab, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogManager
  gameManager: {fileID: 84319912}
  fatherStep: {fileID: 1764536153}
  botText: {fileID: 1638518260}
  panel: {fileID: 1504726136}
  canvasPointer: {fileID: 1525408282}
  bot: {fileID: 615575289}
  afterEndStep: 0
  canvasEndToggle: 1
  typingSpeed: 0.05
  ItalianSentences:
  - Perfetto, adesso ti mostro la funzione principale delle tue mani.
  - Premendo su i controller il tasto Y o B, attiverai l'attrattore per ciascuna
    mano.
  - Appena finisce il dialogo, prova a prendere il cubo qui in fondo, puntando il
    laser rosso
  - Una volta puntato premi il grlletto posteriore del controller e attira il cubo
    a te.
  - Rilascialo poi nel cubo luminoso dietro di te.
  - Fai una prova!
  EnglishSentences:
  - Perfect, now I'll show you the main function of your hands.
  - Pressing the Y or B  button on the controllers, you will activate the gravity
    gun for each hand.
  - As soon as the dialogue ends, try to take the cube here at the bottom, aiming
    the red laser at it
  - Once aimed, press the rear trigger on the controller and attract the cube to
    you.
  - Then release it into the glowing cube behind you.
  - Let's try!
  toActivateAtEnd:
  - {fileID: 380325282}
  - {fileID: 414730969}
  dialogAudioSource: {fileID: 615575293}
  sentenceClips:
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6a70df7c4b386364d83cafcb4705b108, type: 3}
